ay out so many times that it believes them to be real, and even warning of the talismans is not enough to dissuade it.","abilities":["When HP drops below a certain level, absorbs a nearby <Talisman> and recovers HP"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":350,"def":50,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"pathfinder_artifex":{"slug":"pathfinder_artifex","name":"Pathfinder Artifex","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pathfinder Artifex.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A caster employing unusual Originium Arts. Able to extract energy from special Arts Units to inflict tremendous devastation.","abilities":["While this unit is holding Ammo, attacks inflict Burn. Ammo capacity: 1"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":320,"def":200,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.6}},"explosion_chaser":{"slug":"explosion_chaser","name":"Explosion Chaser","icon":"/enemies-icons/Explosion Chaser.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The Saltheap Cannon is driven not by Originium explosives, but by the kinetic power of saltfin sinew. Dissatisfied with this state of affairs, some sailors have taken to stuffing improvised powder into metal tubes, trying to create true explosions.","abilities":["Can perform a charged attack, dealing a large amount of Arts Damage to all nearby allied units with a Stun effect","Can ride <Saltfin Shakers>, gaining some of their abilities"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":350,"def":250,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"talisman":{"slug":"talisman","name":"Talisman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Talisman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Paper talisman seen throughout the Garden of Grotesqueries, with various messages written on them: Timetables, notes, tips, prohibitions... Endowed with meaning by the hand of man, it stubbornly refuses to leave anyone that it sticks to.","abilities":["Destroyed after taking a certain number of attacks","When attached to a target, deals Arts damage every second and prevents them from using skills"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":12,"atk":40,"def":100,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"bloody_chef":{"slug":"bloody_chef","name":"Bloody Chef","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bloody Chef.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"More butcher than cook, the fleet's chefs are more adept at dismembering carcasses than making the aftermath fit for human consumption. The smell of blood from the kitchen is enough to make even the most hardened sailors lose their appetite.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked","Nearby enemies and <Saltheap Cannons> take far less Physical/Arts damage from sources in the direction of the shield"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":1000,"def":1500,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"battleline_advance_guard":{"slug":"battleline_advance_guard","name":"Battleline Advance Guard","icon":"/enemies-icons/Battleline Advance Guard.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Heavily-armed personnel in charge of advancing the frontline. Typically made up of grumpy old veterans who take out their anger towards their superiors on anything standing in their way.","abilities":["Each time this unit is blocked, the next attack's ATK is greatly increased."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":1350,"def":1000,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"battleline_breacher":{"slug":"battleline_breacher","name":"Battleline Breacher","icon":"/enemies-icons/Battleline Breacher.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Heavily-armored personnel in charge of breaking through enemy lines. They only know how to swing their hammer, whether it's towards a roadblock or a living person.","abilities":["Each time this unit is blocked, the next attack's ATK is greatly increased."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1750,"def":1000,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"stress_relief_helper":{"slug":"stress_relief_helper","name":"Stress-Relief Helper","icon":"/enemies-icons/Stress-Relief Helper.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Punching robot used for stress relief by gang members. It would very much like to be on the punching side for once. The gang members who use it do not know that their stress has simply been transferred from human to robot, and it will return the favor someday.","abilities":["Bounces <'Certain Fates'>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":3000,"def":1500,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":7}},"duck_lord":{"slug":"duck_lord","name":"Duck Lord","icon":"/enemies-icons/Duck Lord.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A famous Columbian investor, entrepreneur, and master of 'Duck Power.' Out of the public eye, enjoys kicking back with others...","abilities":["Cannot be blocked.","Gains significantly increased Movement Speed after being attacked"],"levelCount":3,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":100,"def":300,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"strange_gourd":{"slug":"strange_gourd","name":"Strange Gourd","icon":"/enemies-icons/Strange Gourd.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A gourd that turned into a geist, with an incessant desire for hoarding despite not being particularly active. When disturbed, it tries to draw everything around it into its interior.","abilities":["Strange Gourd gains increased HP and ATK based on the amount of Originium Ingots owned","Steals Originium Ingots upon entering the Objective."],"levelCount":3,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":900,"def":700,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.2}},"crying_thief":{"slug":"crying_thief","name":"Crying Thief","icon":"/enemies-icons/Crying Thief.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Perro who left his family to seek out a new life... but all that people know is that he is always weeping.","abilities":["Invisible","Attacks Stun the target"],"levelCount":3,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":500,"def":250,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.9}},"fatty":{"slug":"fatty","name":"Fatty","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fatty.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Duck Lord's associate and apprentice, an opportunist with a slick tongu